title: 20 Chiptunes on the Gameboy

cover_description: The title sits at the top, above the interface of LSDJ showing the song structure

cover: cover.jpg

-- synopsis
Trying out some chiptunes on the Gameboy using the LSDJ rom (emulated, I need to figure out how to get it on a cartridge).
It's been a long time since I've made anything in it, but surprisingly easy to hop back in.

(Go back to the album Downloads for the Strudel code).
-- synopsis